OL,3,APolice told Russell Brand to leave
OL,4,AJemima Goldsmith's house in 2014
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have confirmed they told Russell
OL,7,FBrand to leave his ex-girlfriend Jemima
OL,8,FGoldsmith's house in 2014 after she
OL,9,Fclaimed a violent incident took place.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police said officers were
OL,12,Fcontacted by an alleged victim and went
OL,13,Fto an address in Oxfordshire on 25 July
OL,14,F2014 but no arrests were made.
OL,16,FThey listened to her concerns and gave
OL,17,Fsupport, and "also ensured the victim's
OL,18,Fpartner left the address, as per the
OL,19,Fvictim's wishes", the police added in a
OL,20,Fstatement on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
