OL,3,AVinicius Jr sends message to Sudan boy
OL,4,Awho received prosthetic legs after BBC
OL,5,Areport sparks appeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FWe first met Zaher a year ago in the
OL,8,Fruins of Sudan's capital, Khartoum. He
OL,9,Fwas a small quiet child, scarred by war
OL,10,F- one of millions of children whose
OL,11,Flives have been upended since the
OL,12,Fcountry's army and the paramilitary
OL,13,FRapid Support Forces (RSF) started
OL,14,Ffighting in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
